msgstr "用于在数据类型之间安全地转换"

#: development/engine/variant_class.rst:21
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Be used to abstract calling methods and their arguments (Rebel Engine "
"exports all its functions through variants)"
msgstr "用于抽象调用方法及其参数(Godot通过Variant对象导出其所有函数)"

#: development/engine/variant_class.rst:23
msgid "Be used to defer calls or move data between threads."
msgstr "用于推迟调用或在线程之间交换数据."

#: development/engine/variant_class.rst:24
msgid "Be serialized as binary and stored to disk, or transferred via network."
msgstr "被序列化为二进制并存储到磁盘, 或通过网络传输."

#: development/engine/variant_class.rst:26
