msgstr "在生成路径上随机选取一个位置。"

#: getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:227
msgid "Get the player's position."
msgstr "获取玩家的位置。"

#: getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:228
msgid ""
"Call the mob's ``initialize()`` method, passing it the random position and "
"the player's position."
msgstr "调用小怪的 ``initialize()`` 方法，传入随机位置和玩家的位置。"

#: getting_started/first_3d_game/05.spawning_mobs.rst:230
