#: getting_started/first_3d_game/09.adding_animations.rst:238
msgid "Animating the mobs"
msgstr "为小怪制作动画"

#: getting_started/first_3d_game/09.adding_animations.rst:240
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Here's another nice trick with animations in Rebel Engine: as long as you "
"use a similar node structure, you can copy them to different scenes."
