msgstr "环绕速度速度用于使粒子绕它们的中心转动."

#: tutorials/2d/particle_systems_2d.rst:246
msgid "Linear Acceleration"
msgstr "Linear Acceleration(线性加速度)"

#: tutorials/2d/particle_systems_2d.rst:248
