msgstr ""
"确保在进行下一步之前，你已经保存了项目。在转换之前，最好总是保存并做备份。"

#: tutorials/3d/portals/rooms_and_portals_example.rst:73
msgid ""
"Select the RoomManager, and you will see a button in the toolbar at the top "
