#: tutorials/3d/reflection_probes.rst:15
msgid ""
"They are efficient to render, but expensive to compute. This leads to a "
"default behavior where they only capture on scene load."
msgstr ""
"它们的渲染效率高, 但计算成本也高. 这就造成默认的行为, 即它们只在场景加载时捕"
