#: tutorials/3d/spatial_material.rst:148
msgid "Use as Albedo"
msgstr "Use as Albedo（用作反照率）"

#: tutorials/3d/spatial_material.rst:150
msgid "Choosing this option means vertex color is used as albedo color."
msgstr "选择此选项意味着用顶点颜色作为反射颜色."

#: tutorials/3d/spatial_material.rst:153
