msgstr ""
"当复制节点且下一块具有相似形状时, 可以编辑上一个多边形, 而不是绘制新多边形."

#: tutorials/animation/2d_skeletons.rst:81
msgid ""
"After moving the polygon, remember to update the UV by selecting Edit -> "
