#: tutorials/best_practices/project_organization.rst:13
msgid "Organization"
msgstr "组织"

#: tutorials/best_practices/project_organization.rst:15
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Rebel Engine is scene-based in nature, and uses the filesystem as-is, "
"without metadata or an asset database."
msgstr ""
"Godot本质上是基于场景的, 并按原样使用文件系统, 而没有元数据或资产数据库."

#: tutorials/best_practices/project_organization.rst:18
