"to behavior, not start it. Note that signal names are usually past-tense "
"verbs like \"entered\", \"skill_activated\", or \"item_collected\"."
msgstr ""
"连接信号。极其安全，但只能用于“响应”行为，而不是启动它。请注意，信号名称通常"
