msgstr "对于十六进制数字，请使用小写字母，因为它们较矮，使数字更易于阅读。"

#: tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_styleguide.rst:498
msgid ""
"Take advantage of GDScript's underscores in literals to make large numbers "
