"一下清单."

#: tutorials/scripting/visual_script/nodes_purposes.rst:402
msgid "By Type"
msgstr "按类型"

#: tutorials/scripting/visual_script/nodes_purposes.rst:404
msgid ""
"Those are the methods available to basic types. For example, if you want a "
"dot-product, you can search for \"dot\" instead of the Vector3 category. In "
"most cases just search the list of nodes, it should be faster."
msgstr ""
"这些是基本类型可用的方法. 例如, 如果你想要一个点积, 你可以搜索 ``点(dot)`` 而"
"不是 ``Vector3`` 类型. 在大多数情况下, 只需搜索节点列表即可, 它应该更快."

#: tutorials/scripting/visual_script/nodes_purposes.rst:409
msgid "Call"
msgstr "调用(``Call``)"

#: tutorials/scripting/visual_script/nodes_purposes.rst:411
msgid ""
"This is the generic calling node. It is rarely used directly but by dragging "
"to empty space on an already configured node."
msgstr ""
"这是通用调用节点. 很少直接使用它, 而是通过拖动到已配置的节点上的空白处."

#: tutorials/scripting/visual_script/nodes_purposes.rst:415
msgid "Constructors"
msgstr "构造函数"

#: tutorials/scripting/visual_script/nodes_purposes.rst:417
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"These are all the functions needed to create Rebel Engine basic datatypes. "
"For example, If you need to create a Vector3 out of 3 floats, a constructor "
