msgid ""
"Finally, we start the fuse particles by setting ``fuse_particles.visible`` "
"to ``true``."
msgstr ""
"最后, 通过将 ``fuse_particles.visible`` 设置为 ``true`` 来启动引信粒子."

#: tutorials/vr/openvr/vr_starter_tutorial_part_two.rst:767
msgid "Bomb finished"
