"is an :ref:`AudioStreamPlayer3D <class_AudioStreamPlayer3D>` node that holds "
"a sound for the sword colliding with something."
msgstr ""
"这里并没有发生很多事情. 所有根 ``Sword`` 的子节点 :ref:`RigidBody "
